; complex TRAP: events (no key) self-joined on NULLIFE(ev_kind) then GMAX ev_val per row; '' becomes NULL and HJOIN drops NULL keys, a GROUP rewrite must filter them (S3); GMAX keeps the first of equal values (1.5 vs 1.50)
LOAD   vk, events.ev_kind
LOAD   vv, events.ev_val
LOAD   vt, events.ev_at
NULLIFE k, vk
HJOIN  a, b, k, k
GATHER vb, vv, b
GROUP  g, a
GFIRST f, g
GATHER pos, a, f
GMAX   mx, g, vb
GATHER o1, vk, pos
GATHER o2, vt, pos
GATHER o3, vv, pos
OUT    o1, o2, o3, mx
